DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nJoin us at Merchants Millpon
 d State Park for a creative\, family-friendly art experience inspired by t
 he natural beauty of the park. Together\, we’ll explore the sights\, tex
 tures\, and patterns of the millpond and use them as inspiration for hands
 -on art activities.\n\nParticipants will have the opportunity to experimen
 t with simple\, nature-based art experiences that encourage curiosity\, cr
