 o the worksite and will have to carry our own supplies out and back. No ex
 perience is required and all materials will be provided. Please wear close
 -toed shoes and proper attire. Please bring plenty of water and snacks. \n
 \nAdmission to Chimney Rock Attraction will be waived for volunteers who s
 ign-up in advance by end of day on August 14. To sign-up\, email Ranger To
 wnsend at: robert.townsend@ncparks.gov
