DESCRIPTION:This will be a self-guided hike that you can complete anytime t
 hroughout the day of 8/15/26.\n\nCome celebrate the 17th anniversary and e
 ighth National TRACK Trails Day at Lake James State Park! National TRACK T
 rails Day is an annual holiday celebrating the Kids in Parks’ national n
 etwork of family-friendly TRACK Trails and our dedication to getting child
 ren and families outside. \n\nOur TRACK Trail is located on the Holly Disc
 overy Trail as you enter Lake James State Park-Paddy's Creek Access. The p
 arking lot\, is the first parking lot on the left after you cross the entr
 ance bridge on Lake James State Park Road. After you park\, walk over to t
 he TRACK Trails Kiosk to grab an activity brochure to complete as you hike
  the Holly Discovery Trail. Once you complete the hike and activity brochu
 re\, take the completed brochure to the visitor center to receive custom T
 RACK Trails Prizes. You will be able to claim your prize during the vistor
  center operating hours of 9am-5pm on a first come\, first serve basis\, w
 ith limited quanitites available.\n\nFor more information please visit htt
 ps://www.kidsinparks.com/\n\nOr call Lake James State Park Visitor Center 
 828-544-6801
GEO:35.760718;-81.882276
