DESCRIPTION:Do you like the stars? Do you wish you had a clearer\, closer v
 iew at the vast beauty of the sky above us? Would you like to learn about 
 the wild parts of our universe while sipping some hot chocolate? If so\, j
 oin us on August 15th for our second Astronomy Night! This event is after 
 hours\, from 8pm to 9:30pm. You'll get a bonus sticker for bringing your o
 wn reusable mug! If you're interested in attending\, please call (910) 436
