DESCRIPTION:The Scott Family Collection of Alamance Community College will 
 open their new exhibit\, We Remember You\, Legend and Lore from the Days o
 f the American Revolution\, on Tuesday\, August 18\, 2026 with a reception
  from 2-4 pm. The location is 316 Gee Building\, 1247 Jimmie Kerr Road\, G
 raham\, NC 27253. The exhibit profiles 6 ancestors of the Scott family of 
 the Hawfields\, describing their experiences/contributions to the American
  Revolution. The seventh person profiled was not an ancestor but he was ju
 st too interesting to leave out. This exhibit will be open until January 2
 027. The Gallery is open Tuesday/Wed/Thursday from 8 am to 4 pm.
