DESCRIPTION:Join us at Mayo River State Park for a kayaking trip along the 
 river!\n\nWe will be meeting at the Mayo River 220 Business Access (Mayo R
 iver Bridge Kayak Launch 3100-3110 US-220 BUS\, Stoneville\, NC 27048). We
  will lead paddlers to the 770 Bridge Pull-out where we will be finishing 
 so paddlers can leave their cars there\, then commute everyone to Anglin M
 ill Access to begin. Depending on the water levels\, the trip can last 4 t
 o 5 hours. Wear clothing that you're comfortable being in water with. Dry 
 bags\, sunscreen\, hats\, water\, snacks\, and your own lifejackets if you
  have them are all recommended. We will have spare lifejackets just in cas
 e. Bring Bagged Lunch as we plan to stop partially through the trip to hav
 e lunch.\n\nEvent is subject to cancel due to poor weather or muddy waters
 . Message the email below to register as we have limited spaces. We will m
 ax out the event at 6 people.
GEO:36.439398;-79.937372
