DESCRIPTION:The Complete History of America (Abridged)\nFriday\, August 28\
 , 2026 through Sunday\, August 31\, 2026 \nMcGregor Hall Performing Arts C
 enter | Henderson\, NC\n\nWhat better way to celebrate the 250th birthday 
 of our country than to enjoy a lighthearted review of the history of these
  United States! 600 years of history in 6\,000 seconds! From Washington to
  Watergate\, yea verily from the Bering Straits to Baghdad\, from New Worl
 d to New World Order – The Complete History of America (Abridged) is a 9
 0-minute rollercoaster ride through the glorious quagmire that is American
  History\, reminding us that it’s not the length of your history that ma
 tters — it’s what you’ve done with it! You don’t want to miss this
  hysterically funny show!\n\nPerformances:\nFriday\, August 28 - 7:30 PM\n
 Saturday\, August 29 - 7:30 PM\nSunday\, August 30 - 3:00PM \n\nFor ticket
 s and information\, visit mcgregorhall.org.\n\nPresented by Henderson Rec 
 Players at McGregor Hall in partnership with America 250.
GEO:36.327154;-78.404751
LOCATION:McGregor Hall Performing Arts Center\, Henderson\, NC
SUMMARY:Vance America 250: The Complete History of America (Abridged)  – 
 A Musical at McGregor Hall
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/vance-america-250-the-comple
 te-history-of-america-abridged-a-musical-at-mcgregor-hall
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts
CATEGORIES:Theater & Musicals
END:VEVENT
