DESCRIPTION:For one day only\, step back into the 19th century as historic 
 textiles take center stage at the home of Major General William Lenoir. Ex
 plore what life was like on the frontier through the clothing\, quilts\, a
 nd other textiles used by the people who lived here. Costumed docents will
  bring these fascinating stories to life on a special tour that offers a r
 are glimpse into the everyday lives of generations past. \n\n \n\nAuthenti
 c textiles will be on display by guided tour of the home. Admission to the
