DESCRIPTION:On September 12\, 2026\, in partnership with the Person County 
 Branch of the Cooperative Extension\, PCMH will invite visitors to step ba
 ck in time to experience life in our area during the late 1700s and early 
 1800s.\n\nCostumed interpreters will demonstrate heritage skills that woul
 d have been used by residents of the Central Piedmont for generations. The
 se include foodways\, domestic tasks (weaving/dyeing/quilting etc)\, agric
 ultural and industrial tasks and much more. Stay tuned for a full descript
 ion of the event.\n\nThis is a free\, all ages event that will take place 
 rain or shine. If you are interested in volunteering to help with this eve
 nt please contact personcountymuseumofhistory@gmail.com.
