 don\, Hunter will share how Wilmington played a role in this beloved serie
 s–all while cruising the Cape Fear River.  This is one of our last cruis
 es for Outlander\, be sure to jump aboard. There is a second cruise on thi
 s date at Noon and another on Sepbmer 13 at 10 AM.\n\nOur boat\, The Wilmi
