DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the spirit of a nation at Stars\, Stripes\, and Sound
 s on September 12th from 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM at River of Life Church—an u
 nforgettable evening of music\, patriotism\, and community in honor of Ame
 rica’s 250th.\n\nThis prestigious concert will feature a powerful collab
 oration between the renowned 2nd Marine Division Band and the distinguishe
 d Band of America’s Few. Together\, they will deliver a stirring perform
 ance filled with patriotic favorites\, timeless classics\, and inspiring m
 usical tributes that honor the legacy and future of our nation.
