 Out invites North Carolina teachers\, specialists\, and school staff to di
 ve in to It’s Revolutionary! \n\nJoin the North Carolina Museum of Histo
 ry on September 15\, 2026\, at Union Hall in Raleigh for a free event desi
 gned just for educators. You’ll enjoy complimentary food and drinks\, ex
 plore hands-on resources\, and meet representatives from organizations acr
 oss the NC Department of Natural and Cultural Resources who are ready to s
 upport your work in and beyond the classroom.\n\nWhether you’re gearing 
 up for a new school year or looking for a fun night with fellow educators\
 , we can’t wait to welcome you for a revolutionary night out! \n\nAttend
 ance is free\, but registration is required.
