DESCRIPTION:Join the Greensboro Astronomy Club for a Deep Space Observation
  at Mayo River State Park!\n\nThe Deep Space Observations are a fun and fr
 ee way to experience the outdoors at night in a whole new way. Experienced
  observers and beginners will be present during the event so feel free to 
 bring any kind of telescope or just a blanket to lay back and admire the s
 tarry sky. The event does not have a specific set start time or end time\,
  come and go as you will. \n\nEvent is subject to cancelation in regards t
 o bad weather or cloudy skies.
