DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Austin for a paddle on the Roanoke Sound.  Learn mo
 re about the aquatic side of Jockey's Ridge.  Discussion will also include
  park ecology and natural/cultural history.  All equipment will be provide
 d to include instruction.  Minimum participant age is 8 years-old.  Childr
 en under 13 must paddle with an adult (18 or older). \n\nPre-registration 
 is required.  Please email austin.paul@ncparksgov to sign up.  Include the
  names of all participants\, ages\, and a contact phone number.  \n\nPleas
 e arrive at least 10 minutes early.\n\nProgram subject to cancellation due
  to imclement weather.\n\nLocation:  330 W Soundside Road\, Nags Head\, NC
  27959
