DESCRIPTION:Join a Ranger for a beginner-level guided paddle (~2.5 mi.) on 
 the Cape Fear River and learn about the plants\, animals\, and ecology of 
 the area. \n\nParticipants must bring their own kayak\, life jacket\, and 
 paddle or rent a kayak and gear through Paddle NC.\n\nMeet in the Marina\,
  next to the Paddle NC boat rental shed. \n\nSpace is limited to 15 people
  with a minimum age requirement of 13 years old. Registration is required.
  Call 910-707-6050 or email carolina.beach@ncparks.gov to register.
GEO:34.045859;-77.905159
LOCATION:Carolina Beach State Park\, Marina - Next to Paddle NC Rental Shed
SUMMARY:Bring Your Own Kayak - Paddle with a Ranger (Beginner Level)
