DESCRIPTION:With two special showtimes\, you can make a full day of Hallowe
 en fun for the kids! Wear your costume and step into a world of wizardry a
 t this spellbinding concert! Enjoy magical music from Harry Potter’s wor
 ld and more. Enter the costume contest and win prizes. Perfect for young w
 itches\, wizards\, ghosts\, and goblins. \n\nFree\, kid-friendly activitie
