DESCRIPTION:Interested in participating in the Sedalia Singers Project? Wel
 l good news\, rehearsals start soon! Starting in September we will be host
 ing rehearsals for the Sedalia Singers Project with a performance culminat
 ing at Christmas in Sedalia on Saturday December 12th!\n\nRehearsals will 
 be held on site on the following dates:\n\n \n\nSeptember 12 and September
  26 from 10am-12pm\n\nOctober 10\, October 17 and October 24 from 10am-12p
 m\n\nNovember 5\, and November 12 from 6pm-8pm\n\nNovember 7 and November 
 14 from 10am-12pm \n\nDecember 3 and December 10 from 6pm-8pm\n\nDecember 
 5 10am-12pm\n\n \n\nQuestions about the project? Contact April Finley at a
 pril.finley@dncr.nc.gov !
