 ldwide HAM radio operator events commemorating:  \n\nThe December 7\, 1941
  attack on Pearl HarborVeterans DayThe Battleship is NI4BK\, and HAM opera
 tors may contact the ship via Voice\, Digital\, and Morse Code. NI4BK look
 s forward to hearing from YOU!\n\nRadio operators making contact will rece
 ive a special postcard verifying the contact.
